1
00:00:15,900 --> 00:00:18,880
Fishing is my favourite sport.

2
00:00:18,880 --> 00:00:24,110
I often fish for hours without catching anything.

3
00:00:24,110 --> 00:00:27,650
But this does not worry me.

4
00:00:27,650 --> 00:00:30,690
Some fishermen are unlucky.

5
00:00:30,690 --> 00:00:37,330
Instead of catching fish, they catch old boots and rubbish.

6
00:00:37,330 --> 00:00:40,240
I am even less lucky.

7
00:00:40,240 --> 00:00:46,480
I never catch anything -- not even old boots.

8
00:00:46,480 --> 00:00:54,860
After having spent whole mornings on the river, I always go home with an empty bag.

9
00:00:54,860 --> 00:00:58,111
'You must give up fishing!'

10
00:00:58,111 --> 00:01:00,062
my friends say.

11
00:01:00,062 --> 00:01:02,500
'It's a waste of time.'

12
00:01:02,500 --> 00:01:07,050
But they don't realize one important thing.

13
00:01:07,050 --> 00:01:10,780
I'm not really interested in fishing.

14
00:01:10,780 --> 00:01:19,370
I am only interested in sitting in a boat and doing nothing at all!
